Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,First Episode\NThe Princess Knight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming! Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ma'am, have you\Nby any chance seen a young girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...with black hair and blue\Neyes, dressed like a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.34,0:02:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen any girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help me! Get\Nme on my feet, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Ladybug, maybe\Nyou can help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a young\Ngirl dressed like a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I really haven't\Nseen a girl like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for her for\N12 years now without finding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how much\Nfurther I'll have to go...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:02:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get me, bandits!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get him! How he fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that! There, you scoundrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! I'm not afraid of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's spray the\Nrevealing liquid on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you up to now?\N- This!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I missed him!\NLet's all spray together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's a girl,\Nshe'll change color!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Run!\N- Quick! - Let's follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward, gallop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to get your butt\Noff the ground? Walk, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Help! I\Ncan't see anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where is that damn bastard?\N- This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not in the river!\NWhere is it less damp?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here or here? Here or here?\NHere! No, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your master\Nnot to have me chased anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Away, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, wake up!\NIt's time to get up! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Ghosts!\NThey have it out for me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Garigori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how much time you've wasted!\NMore than half a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Garigori,\NI have been awake for a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's time to stop\Nteasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:05:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Prince!\NIt's time to get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you\Nclothes suited to your rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No! What are you doing, Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop, please, Prince!\NBe good, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You rascal!\NDoing this to a woman like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Prince? Stop!\NCome here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Opal!\NAre you glad to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take my clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel like\Nwearing those clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel much better in mine.\NNow I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, little horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings to you\Nand may heaven protect you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,our lord\NSovereign of these lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Greetings!\N- May the sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...continue to shine\Nupon your fortunes, and may...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the Prince!\N- The black sheep of the realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The lord of the castle\Nof Tenderloin,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,grand knight of merit of the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the Grand Duke Duralumin\Nof Duralluminium!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am pleased to be in the presence\Nof your august person, Sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I too am glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- But he sees the King every day!\N- You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking, regarding\Nthe deer hunting contest,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it to be grand\Nthis year!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But is there enough money\Nfor the contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally,\Nit will require more taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already prepared the Royal Decree.\NYou need only sign, Sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the Grand Duke the Royal Seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With it,\Nyou can sign in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take that!\N- What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will return later.\NExcuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tumble, eh, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you must take off\Nyour hat in the Throne Room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better! And why are you\Ndressed like a poor swordsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I like this outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It suits me! I can't stand\Nthose pompous clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, remember that\Nyou are the Crown Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You must behave with more dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you address\Nme by only saying: "Hi, dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,," Why, dad? What else\Nwas I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, a bow was required.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's there to laugh about?! Oh, my goodness!\NI lost my balance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning, Baron Nylon!\NIt is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That brat of a Prince\Nprevented me from signing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...in place of the King, the Decree\Nthat increases taxes on the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We will teach him a lesson!\NListen, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how to get rid of\Nthe little Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were known\Nthat he is actually a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he could never again\Nascend the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,because our law forbids\Na woman from reigning as Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:08:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I will reveal the secret\Nand this country will be yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do so,\Nyou will have wealth and honors from me..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as I am proclaimed King!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A King must not yawn\Nin public!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He must not even snicker,\Ncough, or laugh too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He must dress with splendor, show himself\Nalways benevolent and never angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he cannot remain alone,\Nbut must always be..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...accompanied and aided\Nby his vassals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? You\Nshouldn't just look at the pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You must read, if you\Nwant to learn something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was your age, I remember\Nthat I studied very many treatises...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I read many more books\Nthan you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,More than all of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, very many!\NHey, Prince, let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You brat, get me out!\NHelp! Help! Out! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Sapphire, where are you going in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be naughty! Go back\Nto your rooms, you must study.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like studying, mother
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't stand always being\Naround old people in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you shouldn't\Nsay such things!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm leaving! Bye, Mom!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor little girl!\NWhere do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It is because of the law of this\Nkingdom that Sapphire is like this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a season just like this\Nwhen she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He is born! He is born!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejoice, my loyal subjects!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The long-awaited heir is born!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen has given you a Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I have deceived my people.\NI should have announced...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...the birth of a little Princess,\Nnot a little Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You did the right thing!\NThere was nothing else to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.94,0:09:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The law forbids a woman\Nto reign,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,so we must make everyone believe\Nthat she is a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart breaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did my husband\Nannounce that she is a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, he had\Nno other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone finds out\Nthat a girl was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke covets the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,we cannot allow him\Nto seize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, as the law demands,\Nit is time for the Grand Duke...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...to pay homage\Nto His Highness the little Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, heavens! Wait a\Nmoment! We are not ready yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You must show the little Prince!\NDon't waste any more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do\Nso he doesn't discover the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Place next to her\Na boy's toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke will be deceived
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, you may enter\Nto observe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,..His Highness the Little Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.66,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I pay homage to His Highness and\Nwish him to grow up healthy and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In this way they managed\Nto deceive the Grand Duke..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...and hide the truth\Nfrom the court and the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,From then on, Sapphire was raised\Nas a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,with the complicity of the doctor,\Nthe nurse, and the chamberlain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seasons passed,\Nmeanwhile, Sapphire grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She was only allowed games\Ntypical of boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth was\Ncarefully kept hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire was slowly raised to\Nhave the mindset of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So that the kingdom would not fall\Ninto the hands of the evil Grand Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire grew up without knowing\Nthe small, great joys...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...that bloom\Nin the female soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Sapphire!\NHow unhappy I feel for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you, Prince? Are you taking\Na solitary walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Nylon, I cannot feel\Nany pleasure in this meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry, Prince, to hear you\Nspeak this way towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They say you are skilled in fencing. I\Nwould like to measure myself against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fine!\N- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- On guard!\N- Just the two of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad for a boy!\NTake this! And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A lunge! There! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like this blow, eh, Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Remember that it was only a game!\N- You lost, it seems!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want another round?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?! I\Nwill win the next contest: archery!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you are capable of doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like apples?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got another idea\Nfor another contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,An embroidery contest! Whoever makes it\Nthe most beautiful and in the shortest time wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you? How\Ndare you challenge me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...to a contest in which I'd have\Nto perform such feminine work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, now you will tell me\Nwhy you had me followed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...by your men over\Nthese last few days!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are you talking\Nabout? I know nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a schemer! Now\Nget out and leave me in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me!\N- Who spoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- And who might you be?\N- My name is Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, you said? And where\Non earth did you pop out from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's been 12 years\Nthat I've been looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are a girl, aren't you?\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, tell the truth! I\Nknow that you are a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not true, I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I tell you that you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I told you I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to say you're not a female?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine. But\Nhow do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...\Nit's just that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...you were an angel.\N- You were an angel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a real angel,\Nbefore becoming a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vengo dal Paradiso
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I searched for you a lot\Nbefore managing to find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sent to make you\Na sweet girl, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to make me\Na sweet girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you want,\Nyou can even try,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm very much afraid that you\Nwill never succeed in this goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, am sure\Nthat I will succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- We'll see each other one of these days!\N- Keep my secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of good-for-nothing\Nidiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ashamed that my henchmen\Nare proving to be so incompetent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you ashamed of having\Ngotten yourselves thrown into the river...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...by that stupid brat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, idiots!\NDid you use the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...that sprays that liquid which makes it possible\Nto tell men from women?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried, Baron, but that\Nliquid had no effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!... Oh, look!\NThe liquid is working!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Baron has changed color!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, now, he will be sure\Nof being a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a terrible complexion!\N- Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Baron,\NI am the alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! I was waiting for you! Have\Nyou brought the drug I asked you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me: is it true that whoever\Ntakes it confesses any of their secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- You, assassins!\N- At your command, Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This time we will use this\Nnew drug, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to make the Prince drink it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, to the Queen.\N- To the Queen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly! You will\Ngive it to the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen must know the Prince's secret\Nbetter than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,With this drug, finally,\Nthe Queen will reveal to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,..if Sapphire is a girl\Nor not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, you will lure\NSapphire into the enchanted forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,where there is a wolf\Nthat feeds on human flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's time! Let's split up!\N- Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?\NThis way or that way? This way? That way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.38,0:16:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see them anymore. Who knows where\Nthose three assassins have hidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the feeling I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And this place doesn't make me\Nfeel at ease at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the Duke, Your Grace.\N- Hello, Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you desire something?\N- A merchant has brought me..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...a very rare elixir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It is very sweet\Nand I am sure you will like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You are very kind, Duke
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baron Nylon!\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Would you like to taste some?\N- No! Well, actually, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...for the last few days\NI have become a bit of a teetotaler!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nonsense! Just a drop!\N- Only a drop...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo! That's how you keep\Ncompany with Her Grace the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now to you, my Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I am truly lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And now who knows what\Nwill be the way out of the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that\Nyou are lost, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, old woman. Can you\Nshow me which way I should go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a wolf that feeds\Non human flesh, in the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful! This wolf has\Nlived here for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...and it is very cunning and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go that way,\Nyou'll find a hut...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...where you can take shelter\Ntonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go there! Thank you, old woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The drug we put\Nin the elixir...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...will take effect\Nwithin two hours at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen will willingly reveal to us\Nthe Prince's secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...and she will tell us if he\Nis actually a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but you too will reveal\Nyour secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You have also drunk\Nthe drugged elixir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There is so much dust\Nin this hut!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the wolf's tracks!\NMy goodness, he must be huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're Tink!\NDo you know you scared me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how you greet a friend?\NI came to warn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you've been deceived! This\Nis the hut where the wolf lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you saying?\N- Yes! That wolf is so clever
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.94,0:19:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...that he sends travelers to this\Nhut to devour them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A robin told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,See those hats? They belonged\Nto the people he devoured!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If what you say is true,\Nthen I am lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that when the wolf realizes\Nthat its prey is a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- it lets her go.\N- If you think that for this reason
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dress as a girl, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Would you prefer to be devoured?\N- I will never dress as a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.34,0:20:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go! Sapphire, do you know that you are\Nreally so pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you knew how ridiculous I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to behave\Nlike a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait\Nto get these rags off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.66,0:20:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- The wolf! Here comes the wolf!\N- The wolf is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him get close and strike\Nhim by surprise! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel a sharp pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,• Is there something wrong,\Nmy Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to confide a\Nsecret of mine to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry! And who\Nthe hell is that over there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks like a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! The wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.90,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't be afraid!\NAnd now what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing more disgusting\Nthan a little girl dying of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you like flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer a piece of cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid of me! I\Nwill be so good to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't tremble! You make me\Nnervous! What do you want me to do to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.14,0:21:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Eh? What do you want?\N- I just need you to become smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No! You have to become even\Nmuch smaller!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Like this?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you! I will stop you\Nfrom doing any more harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.62,0:21:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked me! And it's\Nover for you, damn little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My paw! No! Not my paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:22:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Again!\N- Not my paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose! My nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.62,0:22:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Not the fire! Not the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Sapphire! You\Ndid it! You defeated the wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret I would like to\Nconfide concerns Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go! The Queen is\Nabout to reveal the secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.54,0:22:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally I will know\Nif the Prince is a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.54,0:23:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I must confess to you\Nthat actually Sapphire is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, I will say it!\NSapphire - What, Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I too, my Queen, have a\Nsecret to reveal! Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell you: the Grand Duke\Nhas put a drug in the elixir...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...which will force you to reveal if\Nthe Prince is truly a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you confess that he is not,\Nthe Grand Duke will be able to seize power...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You've ruined everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is about to reveal\Nwhether you are male or female,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,because she drank a drug\Nthat the Grand Duke gave her!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What a schemer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.74,0:23:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- What did you do to my mother?\N- Nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.46,0:23:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go away!\N- My regards!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.50,0:24:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was about to reveal your secret!\N- Yes, I know, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.06,0:24:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But we will continue to pretend\Nthat I am a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.82,0:24:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,until in our kingdom\Nthere are no more villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.74,0:24:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.30,0:24:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And so the story ended.
